+issueNumber: MDL-88319
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new hook, `\core\hook\output\before_help_icon_rendered`, is now
+        dispatched from `core_renderer::render_help_icon()` before the
+        `core/help_icon` template is rendered. Plugins can use it to modify the
+        popover template context (`get_context()`), inject HTML before or
+        after the icon (`add_before_icon()` / `add_after_icon()`), or replace
+        the help icon output entirely (`set_replacement()`).
+      type: improved
